Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.18,0:00:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The Princess Sapphire\NKnight of the Ribbon
Comment: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:50.16,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k72}{\k14}A{\k32}ta{\k40}shi {\k48}no {\k35}mi{\k52}ru {\k45}yu{\k34}me{\k30} {\k41}hi{\k44}mi{\k43}tsu {\k27}na{\k39}no{\k20}
Comment: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:50.16,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,The dreams I see are my secret
Comment: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:57.09,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k53}{\k24}Da{\k13}re{\k25} {\k40}ni {\k36}mo {\k68}iwa{\k68}nai{\k56} {\k43}hi{\k40}mi{\k55}tsu {\k31}na{\k32}no
Comment: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:57.09,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,I won’t tell anyone—it’s my secret
Comment: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.46,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k27}{\k45}A{\k26}ka{\k22}i {\k43}man{\k19}to {\k40}hi{\k26}ra {\k23}hi{\k75}ra{\k46}
Comment: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.46,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,A red cape fluttering
Comment: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k0}{\k12}U{\k25}ma {\k21}o {\k18}to{\k28}ba{\k15}su {\k91}ou{\k42}jo
Comment: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,Galloping on a horse—the princess
Comment: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k28}So{\k27}re {\k21}ga {\k15}a{\k12}{\k23}ta{\k31}shi{\k35}
Comment: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,That’s me!
Comment: 0,0:01:07.62,0:01:10.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k12}{\k12}Lu{\k38}la{\k11} {\k20}du{\k10}la{\k19} {\k48}lu{\k53}la {\k43}du{\k40}la{\k22}
Comment: 0,0:01:10.91,0:01:13.42,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k23}{\k26}Lu{\k26}lu{\k13} {\k49}laa, {\k19}lu{\k40}laa{\k55}
Comment: 0,0:01:14.54,0:01:18.02,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k12}{\k12}Lu{\k38}la{\k11} {\k20}du{\k10}la{\k19} {\k48}lu{\k53}la {\k43}du{\k40}la{\k22}
Comment: 0,0:01:18.14,0:01:20.74,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k23}{\k26}Lu{\k26}lu{\k13} {\k49}laa, {\k19}lu{\k40}laa{\k55}
Comment: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k12}{\k52}Ri{\k44}bon {\k38}no {\k35}ki{\k59}shi {\k115}wa{\k17}
Comment: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,The Knight of the Ribbon,
Comment: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k6}{\k50}Hon{\k43}to {\k33}wa {\k92}hon{\k43}tto {\k49}wa{\k24}
Comment: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,Truly, truly,
Comment: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k18}{\k23}A{\k23}ta{\k27}shi {\k35}na{\k35}no {\k159}sa{\k0}
Comment: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,It’s really me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.10,0:01:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Forty-Sixth Episode\NThe Butterfly Witch\NSapphire of the Mysterious Forest
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.78,0:01:57.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.45,0:01:59.44,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll soon reach the hill overlooking my castle!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.78,0:02:00.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep up! Don't fall behind!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.76,0:02:02.76,Default,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.32,0:02:12.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.48,0:02:13.98,Default,,0,0,0,,The town of Goldland is on fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.68,0:02:15.68,Default,,0,0,0,,What could have happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.33,0:02:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, I'm going to check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.10,0:02:23.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You go straight home.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.30,0:02:27.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe I can help too, Franz.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.74,0:02:31.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Nonsense, a little fire like that is nothing. I can handle it alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.94,0:02:36.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, don't follow me. Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.00,0:02:41.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I wonder if Franz will be okay by himself.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.75,0:02:45.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I went to help, but Franz stopped me...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.02,0:02:47.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm really worried.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.86,0:02:50.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I know, let me sneak over and take a look.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.75,0:02:55.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Opal, keep watch for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.65,0:03:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no! The Ribbon Knight set the fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.53,0:03:29.57,Default,,0,0,0,,The fire was set by the Ribbon Knight!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.60,0:03:32.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the Ribbon's Knight!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.22,0:03:34.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the Ribbon!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.94,0:03:35.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Who set it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.95,0:03:36.95,Default,,0,0,0,,It was the Ribbon!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.55,0:03:04.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.96,0:03:06.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.52,0:03:50.34,Default,,0,0,0,,What on earth happened? What's with this fire?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.42,0:03:54.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Forgive me, Your Highness, but Ribbon Knight is the one who set this fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.70,0:03:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The Ribbon Knight?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.50,0:03:59.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Something's off about the Ribbon Knight...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.00,0:04:08.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, leave this to us and evacuate to safety!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.60,0:04:18.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry, we have to stop the fire from spreading!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.06,0:04:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince Franz!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.54,0:04:24.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the Ribbon Knight!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.02,0:04:25.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.40,0:04:27.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Curse you, Ribbon Knight!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.29,0:04:29.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.59,0:04:34.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me! I'm scared!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.72,0:04:35.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.44,0:04:41.44,Default,,0,0,0,,That was close!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.72,0:04:42.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You're safe now!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.81,0:04:43.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Ribbon Knight!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.64,0:04:46.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew it was you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.66,0:04:51.42,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you show your face before me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.41,0:04:53.97,Default,,0,0,0,,What? What's wrong with you, Prince Franz?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.54,0:04:57.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't play dumb! You set this fire, didn't you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.29,0:05:00.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Me? Set a fire...?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.75,0:05:03.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Still playing innocent?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.38,0:05:06.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't let you get away with this today! Prepare yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.36,0:05:09.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait! This must be some kind of misunderstanding!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.29,0:05:11.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Silence! Talk is useless!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.04,0:05:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, Prince Franz! Saving this child comes first!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.14,0:05:26.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, hurry, Prince Franz!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.62,0:05:30.98,Default,,0,0,0,,The poor thing fainted...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.00,0:05:33.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince Franz! We can talk later...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.26,0:05:34.72,Default,,0,0,0,, Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.64,0:05:36.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.33,0:06:04.08,Default,,0,0,0,,My darling children have returned.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.93,0:06:10.40,Default,,0,0,0,,There, there. I'll give you a special feast.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.57,0:06:17.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, it's night-bug and honey soup!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.42,0:06:18.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, eat up!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.77,0:06:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's there?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.68,0:06:29.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Look out! It's the Ribbon Knight!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.29,0:06:31.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my goodness!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.00,0:06:34.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You big blabbermouth!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.32,0:06:37.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop shouting Ribbon, Ribbon so loudly, you fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.46,0:06:41.53,Default,,0,0,0,,But old hag! You said the Ribbon Knight set the fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.60,0:06:44.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You were the one who told us to yell out loud, right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.94,0:06:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,That was in town for everyone to hear!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.04,0:06:48.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, keep it down and whisper!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.89,0:06:49.91,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, how did it go?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.34,0:06:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Speak louder and clearly!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.48,0:06:57.79,Default,,0,0,0,,But you just told us to whisper!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.70,0:07:00.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You both are complete fools!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.78,0:07:04.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You made Prince Franz believe the Ribbon Knight set the fire, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.28,0:07:09.06,Default,,0,0,0,,So can we have that reward feast now?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.17,0:07:10.46,Default,,0,0,0,,We're starving!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.50,0:07:13.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Not yet! That's nowhere near enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.30,0:07:14.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I've had enough of this!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.63,0:07:16.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate these cramped things!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.87,0:07:19.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.67,0:07:23.14,Default,,0,0,0,,If you refuse to listen to me...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.76,0:07:30.29,Default,,0,0,0,,...I can always stick this onto you instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.32,0:07:31.48,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.02,0:07:34.31,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll do whatever you say!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.63,0:07:36.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Not that again!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.28,0:07:37.88,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't want that either!
Comment: 0,0:07:38.40,0:07:41.14,Obaba the Witch Spells,,0,0,0,karaoke,Sora no yo ni osoroshiku,
Comment: 0,0:07:38.40,0:07:41.14,Obaba the Witch Spells Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,Show them something frightening and eerie,
Comment: 0,0:07:41.16,0:07:44.94,Obaba the Witch Spells,,0,0,0,karaoke,odoro-odoroshii omise.
Comment: 0,0:07:41.16,0:07:44.94,Obaba the Witch Spells Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,like the dark sky.
Comment: 0,0:07:46.65,0:07:48.53,Obaba the Witch Spells,,0,0,0,karaoke,Sora, sora,
Comment: 0,0:07:46.65,0:07:48.53,Obaba the Witch Spells Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,Sky, sky...
Comment: 0,0:07:48.55,0:07:52.64,Obaba the Witch Spells,,0,0,0,karaoke,tanashi yume no sekai he ikun jo!
Comment: 0,0:07:48.55,0:07:52.64,Obaba the Witch Spells Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,off to a wonderful dream world you go!
Comment: 0,0:07:57.22,0:08:01.60,Obaba the Witch Spells,,0,0,0,karaoke,Omaetachi ike! Gorudo randojo e!
Comment: 0,0:07:57.22,0:08:01.60,Obaba the Witch Spells Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,Move it, you guys! To Goldland Castle!
Comment: 0,0:08:02.04,0:08:05.16,Obaba the Witch Spells,,0,0,0,karaoke,Soshite Furansu no heya ni aru homotsu
Comment: 0,0:08:02.04,0:08:05.16,Obaba the Witch Spells Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,And fetch the Prince's treasured sword
Comment: 0,0:08:05.18,0:08:08.58,Obaba the Witch Spells,,0,0,0,karaoke,no oji no ken o totte kurunja!
Comment: 0,0:08:05.18,0:08:08.58,Obaba the Witch Spells Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,from Franz's room!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.14,0:08:13.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Go! Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.16,0:08:15.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.25,0:08:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Has something happened to Franz?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.84,0:09:04.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, it looks like it's in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.68,0:09:13.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You idiot, he's high-class, so we have to be quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.77,0:09:14.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.84,0:09:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, what? It's just a suit of armor.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.58,0:09:25.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.19,0:09:31.26,Default,,0,0,0,,That noise definitely came from this room.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.04,0:09:37.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What, it's just a cat and mouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.67,0:09:46.00,Default,,0,0,0,,If we take this back to the old lady,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.02,0:09:48.70,Default,,0,0,0,,she'll give us a huge feast!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.87,0:10:19.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no! The Prince's sword...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.99,0:10:23.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The Prince's sword is mine. — Ribbon Knight.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.22,0:10:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.20,0:10:29.58,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you make me angry! Curse you, Ribbon Knight!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.00,0:10:33.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.26,0:10:36.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Franz! It's me! Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.41,0:10:38.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.57,0:10:42.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi, Franz!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.49,0:10:45.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire! I told you not to come!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.76,0:10:49.53,Default,,0,0,0,,But the fire's still burning, even though it's night. Is something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.83,0:10:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Something's wrong, all right!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.06,0:10:54.16,Default,,0,0,0,,The Ribbon Knight set fire to the castle town,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.19,0:10:56.44,Default,,0,0,0,,made innocent people suffer,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.46,0:10:59.16,Default,,0,0,0,,and even stole my precious prince's sword!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.25,0:11:02.18,Default,,0,0,0,,The Ribbon Knight? No way...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.73,0:11:04.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't believe it at first either.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.93,0:11:06.65,Default,,0,0,0,,But I saw him fleeing the fire,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.03,0:11:08.94,Default,,0,0,0,,and this note is further proof!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.75,0:11:15.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's strange... Who could have done this?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.70,0:11:19.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you still say it wasn't the Ribbon Knight's doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.40,0:11:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,But maybe it's someone else's plot...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.98,0:11:24.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.75,0:11:26.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop meddling in this!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.20,0:11:28.04,Default,,0,0,0,,But, Franz...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.07,0:11:29.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to hear it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.90,0:11:31.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.19,0:11:36.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Just leave!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.07,0:11:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Franz, let's talk again when you've calmed down.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.60,0:11:42.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.36,0:11:44.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Sapphire...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.90,0:11:57.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I ended up making Franz angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.92,0:12:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Franz, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.97,0:12:10.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Here she comes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.00,0:12:15.27,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't let her get through.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.82,0:12:30.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Opal! Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.85,0:12:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,My poor children...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.05,0:12:46.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that it's come to this,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.85,0:12:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,take this!
Comment: 0,0:12:55.94,0:13:00.48,Obaba the Witch Spells,,0,0,0,karaoke,Omae wa korekara yume no sekai e iku nda.
Comment: 0,0:12:55.94,0:13:00.48,Obaba the Witch Spells Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,You're going to the dream world now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.48,0:13:05.72,Default,,0,0,0,,My head is spinning!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.05,0:13:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, please forgive me for the awful things I said last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.77,0:13:37.46,Default,,0,0,0,,An arrow message!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.60,0:13:43.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Duel location: Today at sunset, waiting by the forest spring. —Ribbon Knight{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.26,0:13:48.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What an impudent Ribbon Knight!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.32,0:13:56.04,Default,,0,0,0,,So many moths...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.64,0:13:58.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Where on earth... am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.89,0:14:03.90,Default,,0,0,0,,How did I end up in a place like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.60,0:14:13.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I see! So this is the fake Ribbon Knight's hideout!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.51,0:14:16.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone's coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.73,0:14:33.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.23,0:14:35.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.62,0:14:40.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Not yet! Go back to the swamp and fetch more glow-worms!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.05,0:14:44.27,Default,,0,0,0,,What a pain!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.70,0:14:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Why haven't you left yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.14,0:14:51.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I'm starving. I can't even move anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.77,0:14:56.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Then can I put this on your faces and bodies?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.98,0:14:59.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine, we'll just go, alright?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.03,0:15:04.80,Default,,0,0,0,,She's sleeping soundly, completely unaware.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.16,0:15:10.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Now then, change into Ribbon Knight's clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.57,0:15:16.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it! The spell wore off!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.22,0:15:20.70,Default,,0,0,0,,So you're the one doing evil with a fake Ribbon Knight!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.40,0:15:26.08,Default,,0,0,0,,This time, I'll turn {\i1}you{\i0} into the fake Ribbon Knight!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.09,0:15:44.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you really think I'd let you escape so easily?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.66,0:15:47.92,Default,,0,0,0,,How's that? You can't even move anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.14,0:15:51.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait here. In the meantime, I'll bring Franz over.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.59,0:15:53.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Franz?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.18,0:15:58.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Come, my sweet children, follow me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.26,0:16:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,They're plotting something again.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.29,0:16:05.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to warn Franz right away...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.93,0:16:11.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Franz!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.27,0:16:12.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Franz!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.29,0:16:14.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't come here!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.23,0:16:36.44,Default,,0,0,0,,He's late! After sending me a challenge to a duel!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.47,0:16:37.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Curse that Ribbon Knight!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.58,0:16:40.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.84,0:16:57.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Who goes there?
Comment: 0,0:16:58.81,0:17:01.85,Obaba the Witch Spells,,0,0,0,karaoke,Furansu ojiyo, Ribon no kishi wa
Comment: 0,0:16:58.81,0:17:01.85,Obaba the Witch Spells Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,Prince Franz, that cowardly Ribbon Knight
Comment: 0,0:17:01.87,0:17:03.67,Obaba the Witch Spells,,0,0,0,karaoke,hikyo ni mo yattekonai.
Comment: 0,0:17:01.87,0:17:03.67,Obaba the Witch Spells Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,isn't going to show up.
Comment: 0,0:17:04.00,0:17:05.80,Obaba the Witch Spells,,0,0,0,karaoke,Wasu ga Ribon no Kishi
Comment: 0,0:17:04.00,0:17:05.80,Obaba the Witch Spells Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,I shall take you to
Comment: 0,0:17:05.81,0:17:08.19,Obaba the Witch Spells,,0,0,0,karaoke,no sumika e tsuretetteyaro.
Comment: 0,0:17:05.81,0:17:08.19,Obaba the Witch Spells Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,the Ribbon Knight's lair.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.25,0:17:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,My head is spinning...
Comment: 0,0:17:12.55,0:17:15.83,Obaba the Witch Spells,,0,0,0,karaoke,Izumi o fukaku chi ni sakanake,
Comment: 0,0:17:12.55,0:17:15.83,Obaba the Witch Spells Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,Springs, tear deep into the earth!
Comment: 0,0:17:15.85,0:17:18.75,Obaba the Witch Spells,,0,0,0,karaoke,honoyo takaku ten o kogase,
Comment: 0,0:17:15.85,0:17:18.75,Obaba the Witch Spells Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,Flames, burn high and scorch the heavens!
Comment: 0,0:17:18.77,0:17:21.83,Obaba the Witch Spells,,0,0,0,karaoke,soshite watashi no kawai kodomotachiyo
Comment: 0,0:17:18.77,0:17:21.83,Obaba the Witch Spells Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,And my sweet children, dance and
Comment: 0,0:17:21.86,0:17:25.40,Obaba the Witch Spells,,0,0,0,karaoke,odotte konoyo no saigo o iwau noja.
Comment: 0,0:17:21.86,0:17:25.40,Obaba the Witch Spells Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,celebrate the end of this world!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.90,0:17:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Franz, go to the watermill in the forest. And kill that wretched Ribbon Knight.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.31,0:17:51.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Curse that Ribbon Knight...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.09,0:18:07.75,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter how much you struggle, you'll never escape that hag.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.78,0:18:09.91,Default,,0,0,0,,She's terrifying.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.10,0:18:11.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Cowards!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.64,0:18:15.76,Default,,0,0,0,,What?! Don't you feel pathetic being bossed around by an old hag like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.44,0:18:19.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We've tried to escape plenty of times,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.98,0:18:22.31,Default,,0,0,0,,but she casts strange spells on us every time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.34,0:18:25.87,Default,,0,0,0,, So let's team up and defeat that hag!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.15,0:18:29.71,Default,,0,0,0,,If you untie these ropes,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.73,0:18:31.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll beat the hag myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.63,0:18:34.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You two run away while I do. How about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.92,0:18:40.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.67,0:18:42.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna do it too!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.47,0:18:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Obaba!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.99,0:18:48.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It was only for a little bit...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.48,0:18:54.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Franz!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.01,0:19:01.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Franz, tear this Ribbon Knight to pieces with your sword! Quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.93,0:19:06.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You wretched Ribbon Knight!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.83,0:19:09.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Franz!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.95,0:19:10.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.29,0:19:21.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Franz! Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.27,0:19:27.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait... Sapphire?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.91,0:19:28.91,Default,,0,0,0,,What on earth...?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.53,0:19:31.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me a break...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.08,0:19:33.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You were just trying to kill me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.88,0:19:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What? You?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.27,0:19:37.46,Default,,0,0,0,,That old hag put a spell on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.01,0:19:40.99,Default,,0,0,0,,And she used a fake Ribbon Knight to torment you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.92,0:19:47.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.46,0:19:48.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Franz!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.07,0:19:59.57,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.64,0:20:03.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.67,0:20:04.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Running scared, are you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.74,0:20:36.97,Default,,0,0,0,,The ceiling...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.62,0:20:40.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Franz! The door won't open!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.76,0:20:43.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it! It's a trap!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.90,0:20:56.74,Default,,0,0,0,,How's that? Now you know how terrifying the Madame of X-Union is!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.20,0:20:59.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It was an X-Union trap!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.49,0:21:01.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Again today!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.54,0:21:03.55,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.58,0:21:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Curse those annoying brats! I have to bring the ceiling down fast, or else...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.63,0:21:33.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Just you wait...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.81,0:21:35.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Franz! Let's get out fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.90,0:21:44.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Franz!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.80,0:21:46.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, I did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.21,0:22:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sick and tired of pretending to be the fake Ribbon Knight!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.10,0:22:31.81,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it was my fault for misunderstanding the Ribbon Knight.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.05,0:22:35.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Also, pardon me, but I must return this to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.85,0:22:39.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, keep it as a token of thanks for saving us.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.76,0:22:43.03,Default,,0,0,0,,My, such a wonderful gift?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.11,0:22:44.16,Default,,0,0,0,,We couldn't possibly.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.42,0:22:47.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't hesitate. Another agent from X-Union might show up anytime.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.40,0:22:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Please keep it safe for when that time comes.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.33,0:22:54.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the one who got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.81,0:22:56.84,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it was me, it was me!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.86,0:22:58.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the one who fetched this, me!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.56,0:23:01.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You two shouldn't fight—you need to get along.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.20,0:23:03.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.99,0:23:05.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.86,0:23:08.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire now, let's join forces and fight together as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.74,0:23:09.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, Franz.
