Comment: 0,0:23:58.98,0:24:02.78,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,A thousand years, ten thousand years, a million years,
Comment: 0,0:24:02.78,0:24:06.10,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k11}{\k47}Rib{\k27}bon {\k25}de {\k33}tsu{\k22}na{\k13}go{\k23}u {\k19}i{\k30}chi{\k19}o{\k7}ku{\k54}-nen
Comment: 0,0:24:02.78,0:24:06.10,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,Let’s connect with ribbons for a billion years!
Comment: 0,0:24:06.10,0:24:10.10,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k33}{\k33}A{\k22}ku{\k25}ma {\k17}ga {\k35}ku{\k36}te {\k24}mo {\k19}a{\k18}ra{\k30}shi {\k11}ga {\k36}ku{\k33}te {\k28}mo
Comment: 0,0:24:06.10,0:24:10.10,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,Even if demons come, even if storms arrive,
